{"id":"625298","name":"香葱蛋炒饭","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/625298/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"隔夜剩米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"3根"},{"name":"香肠","amount":"3根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/625298/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆胡萝切丝（工具切了啦）。","img":"images/625298/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅倒油。","img":"images/625298/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加鸡蛋液。","img":"images/625298/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用筷子沿同一个方向搅拌。炒熟盛出备用。","img":"images/625298/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅倒油。","img":"images/625298/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下胡萝卜丝。","img":"images/625298/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加米饭。","img":"images/625298/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"铲匀。","img":"images/625298/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加鸡蛋。","img":"images/625298/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加香葱。","img":"images/625298/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加盐蔬之鲜。","img":"images/625298/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅前加几滴香油。","img":"images/625298/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/625298/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"香肠切花煎漂亮装盘（放烤箱也可以）。","img":"images/625298/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/625298/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加胡萝卜丝土豆丝炒匀。","img":"images/625298/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"加水没过食材。","img":"images/625298/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"加黑胡椒（白胡椒也可）。","img":"images/625298/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"加盐。","img":"images/625298/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"出锅撒香葱。","img":"images/625298/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"葱香蛋炒饭配土豆汤。活力四射的早餐！一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/625298/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"关键剩米饭不要放在锅里，也不要放冰箱。而是要保证卫生的前提下，放在通风的地方，让米饭里的水分蒸发掉。\n喜欢吃培根的也可以在土豆汤里加入培根。煎过培根直接加土豆丝再加水就OK啦。味道赞的不行…… \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}